  "observations": [
    "All three expanded counters remain strictly contained and preserve one vector outer ink component.",
    "Bell's enclosed counter is measurable at 24px but remains absent under the conservative binary 16px raster test before and after; this operation alone does not establish a native-16 bell repair.",
    "Zoom-in has one vector ink component, while the conservative 16px binary raster reports three ink components both before and after; the prototype preserves rather than resolves that threshold-level behavior."
